{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"Just so you all know how the ArcaniaBot determines if a channel is IC or OOC: if its in the categories 'things you should read', 'social', 'late night time wasters', or any of the staff categories, it assumes all those channels are OOC.\n\nall other categories are IC, and will track.\n\nin addition, anyone with the DM role or Bot role are skipped for tracking.\n\nIf someone's entire comment in a channel is (in parens representing ooc chat) it is also skipped.","created_at":"2021-06-08T16:01:14.769000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"851853389675364363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
