{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"Ima need some help withe avrae dm commands.","created_at":"2021-07-01T16:55:51.951000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"860202056081866782","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"I will pin this after i post it.  If a player dies, give them the 'Spirit' role, and direct them to <#860203398771376198>  as their primary IC Channel.  They can talk to other dead there.\n\nThere is also 5 rooms that as DMs we will be able to read the history of, but players will not.  <#860203979526635552> for example.  When you are working on deals that other players would not hear or know about, or events that others wont be watching, yo can give a specific player access to the channel -making sure to set them to not be able to read history- and talk them through things there.  They are both OOC and IC channels, as you might be describing what is happening to them in character, or talking to a spirit about where they want to come back, in an IC manner.\n\nThis also gives us the DMs an opportunity that if we are 'dealing' with a problematic player, instead of hiding in Direct Messages, we can have the log of the conversation on the server.  If you want the player to be able to see the history, just create a channel under Limbo, and grant them access without removing history access.  The default for the channels there is DMs and bots and that's it, so you'd have to add as needed.)","created_at":"2021-07-01T17:16:11.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"860207173090803803","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"Just so the DMs know when a player dies, take away their player rank, and set them to spirit rank.  this should (as long as rooms are sync'd to parent category) make it so they cannot talk but can see.  There are a few rooms on the server spirits can talk, and if you want a place where they can manifest, just add the spirit rank to the room, and turn on sending messages.","created_at":"2021-07-05T19:56:04.673000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"861696959386222592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
