{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"a player asked me for animals (beasts) appropriate for them to have seen.  If a player asks and you have the time, ask them where their character is from, and just google indigenous animals to that state/region/country and compare to the beats in DDB.  It'll save a lot of work down the road when a druid ends up wanting to wildshape and ask if they have seen X.\n\nIn this case it was Ireland, and the list I made was Aurochs , badger, owl, bat, cat, cow, crab, frog, raven, deer, dog, eagle, fox, goat, hare, hawk, mastiff, mule, lizard, pony, quipper, rat, riding horse, dolphin, scorpion, sea horse, sheep, spider, vulture, war horse, wolf, poisonous snake, constrictor snake","created_at":"2021-07-08T20:39:41.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"862795099951595600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
